/Title (The participating teams will be trained on Rocketry through a one-week IN-SPACe skill development program. The skill development program shall have hands-on workshop for the participating teams in order to train the students in the practical aspects of rocket modelling. The areas of rocketry that the students shall be exposed to include Design of Propulsion Systems, Structural Design, Flight Dynamics and Control, Mechanical Systems design and Engineering, Parachute Systems, Telemetry and Data Acquisition Systems, Technical Project Management)
